# Extending the API safely
- Put new routes under app/server/api following filename method conventions
- Validate inputs with Zod (extend app/schema/zod.ts or add a targeted schema file)
- Enforce auth with server/middleware/auth.ts; use requireAdmin.ts if needed
- Delegate complex work to server/services/*; keep route handlers short
- Use server/clients/prismaClient.ts and redisClient.ts; do not instantiate new Prisma clients ad hoc
- Wrap errors with withErrorHandler.ts or handleApiError.ts and return user-friendly messages where appropriate
- Add tests in app/server/api/__tests__/; see existing test suites for patterns and fixtures
